7. rebrand, wrap, bundle, or make immaterial changes to avoid these restrictions.

Using the Software internally to build, test, maintain, or operate another product does not by
itself violate this Section. Payment for an Output does not by itself violate this Section. Payment
for installation, configuration, maintenance, support, or training does not violate this Section
